nodes.body:
@claude review. Some questions from me:
1. should we consolidate into existing SwiGLU instead of creating new one?
2. does it work with DistMoE which also supports clamping? If so, what's the best UX for everything? I imagine DistMoE transform can take a SwiGLU with optional "limit" and apply together.

